      "reason": "The loop executes once even for an empty slice and waits for the reader's acknowledgment. A matching empty read acknowledges zero bytes, and both operations return zero and nil. The test checks those results with nil slices. Its timeout establishes only that no write result was observed before the timer fired. It does not establish that the writer was scheduled or had reached the handshake.",
